{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人郭柏妍、張馳豪、朱敏瀚、張與辰及周國豐等，昨晚（25日）現身電視城，為節目《飛常好聲音》錄影。</p><p>首次擔任節目司儀的郭柏妍，受訪前一直匿埋背稿，明顯心情緊張，她受訪時坦言最擔心讀錯參賽者名字，因認為説對名字是一種尊重，問到為何會接受今次挑戰</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T07:41:39.894562+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T07:08:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T07:38:16.609862+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T07:38:16.609862+00:00","content_hash":"7b12d7c44b34a85fc458353eba94089be88eb96789417fde73fbc181c0a73884","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}